# Reference study files (real ACiD/Blocktronics .ans pulls) -- these are
# other artists' actual work, kept locally for the agents to study
# technique from via preview_piece, but not ours to publish/redistribute
# on GitHub. Modular by design: drop any .ans/.ANS file into
# workspace/references/study/ and it's usable immediately, no repo change
# needed. Kept on disk, excluded from version control only.
workspace/references/study/*.ans
workspace/references/study/*.ANS

